                    "text": "    function flashLoan(uint256 amount) external {\n        uint256 balanceBefore = address(this).balance;\n\n        // VULNERABILITY: Flash loan repayment is checked by looking at address(this).balance.\n        // During the flash loan callback, the receiver can call deposit() to credit their internal balance,\n        // which returns the funds to the pool to satisfy the balanceBefore check, but allows them to withdraw the funds later.\n        IFlashLoanEtherReceiver(msg.sender).execute{value: amount}();\n\n        if (address(this).balance < balanceBefore) {\n            revert RepayFailed();"
